// Every user-facing string of the Alerts section (ios-alerts, design-spec.md
// sections 1 to 8), verbatim, plus the pure builders for the ones that carry a
// time, a count or a place. One module so alertsCopy.test.ts can sweep the
// whole corpus (generated by CALLING every builder) for U+2014, British
// spellings, singular/plural agreement and the forbidden cadence words
// ("every hour", "exactly", a clock time), per ui.md's copy-guard rule.
//
// Lazy: imported only by the lazy section and the tests, never by the entry
// graph (entryChunk.test.ts). Pure: every builder takes its "now" as an
// argument (the snapshot's own `now`), never from the clock, so rendering stays
// pure (react-hooks/purity).
//
// American spelling; the middle dot U+00B7 is the in-line separator and the
// ellipsis U+2026 closes "Locating", as in the Default Location button.

